<title>FRANCE: Block of Carrefour stock traded.</title>
<headline>Block of Carrefour stock traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 110,000 Carrefour shares changed hands at 3,406 francs in late morning, market sources said on Thursday. The block trade was worth 375 million francs.</p>
</text>
